sleep-lid/0007-power-supply-macsmc-skip-an-unreadable-manufacture-d.patch
sleep-lid/0008-arm64-dts-apple-t6050-keep-the-PMP-s-power-domains-o.patch
sleep-lid/0009-soc-apple-mailbox-receive-T6050-GPU-mailboxes-by-int.patch
sleep-lid/0010-soc-apple-mailbox-receive-T6050-GPU-mailboxes-by-int.patch
display-gpu/0003-drm-apple-offer-only-the-120-Hz-mode-on-the-firmware.patch
